{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49638","headline":"春光好 一 · 欧阳炯","name":"春光好 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天初暖，日初长，好春光。\n万汇此时皆得意，竞芬芳。\n笋迸苔钱嫩绿，花偎雪坞浓香。\n谁把金丝裁翦却，挂斜阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}